  "key_observations_html": "<div style=\"border:1px solid #C7D8E8;border-radius:10px;padding:0.75rem 0.95rem;margin:0.1rem 0 0.55rem;background:#ffffff;box-shadow:0 1px 3px rgba(15,23,42,0.06);\"><ul style=\"margin:0.1rem 0 0 1.05rem;padding:0;color:#1F4C67;font-size:0.9rem;line-height:1.45;\"><li><strong>Stablecoin market cap fell 2.7% over 30D:</strong> Stablecoin market cap at $286.62B (2.7% lower over 30D) points to contracting crypto dollar liquidity\u2014often a tighter tape for market-making, DeFi collateral, and risk appetite. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/business/2026-10-28-coinbase-adds-ripple-rlusd-stablecoin-432009\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Coinbase adds Ripple\u2019s RLUSD stablecoin across retail, exchange and Prime platforms</a> (The Block).</li><li><strong>Stablecoin market structure remains concentration-led:</strong> leadership is still defined by a small set of large issuers/platforms; share shifts matter as much as aggregate market-cap growth. Related: <a href=\"https://thedefiant.io/converge/tradfi-and-fintech/polygon-extends-bank-to-stablecoin-payment-stack-to-solana\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Polygon Extends Bank-to-Stablecoin Payment Stack to Solana</a> (The Defiant).</li><li><strong>Bank rails are pushing stablecoins into treasury workflows:</strong> That pushes demand toward treasury and settlement use cases, not only exchange trading liquidity. Related: <a href=\"https://www.theblock.co/news/defi/2026-10-29-polygon-adds-solana-payment-stack-432115\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Polygon adds Solana to payment stack linking bank accounts, crypto and payouts</a> (The Block).</li></ul><p class=\"takeaways__note\">Context only\u2014not investment advice. Bullets combine on-page data with recent industry headlines.</p></div><p class=\"review-note ko-disclaimer\">Key observations are AI generated and should be reviewed for accuracy.</p>",
